 "titulo": "He cut off Medusa's head without looking 🐍 Perseus Part 2 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "DON'T LOOK",
 "descripcion": "Perseus steals the only eye of three ancient sisters, takes winged sandals and a helmet of invisibility, and walks backwards into the Gorgon's lair using a bronze shield as a mirror.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nCould you fight without looking?\n\nFrom Greek myth: Apollodorus, Library 2.4; Ovid, Metamorphoses 4-5; Hesiod, Theogony.\n#perseus #medusa #greekmythology #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Three old sisters shared *one eye* and one tooth between them.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Only they knew the way to the Gorgons.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So Perseus waited until they passed the eye from hand to hand, and *stole it*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Tell me the way, or you stay blind forever.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "They told him. Find the nymphs at the edge of the world.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The nymphs gave him three weapons of the gods.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Winged sandals. A magic bag. And the helmet of Hades, that makes you invisible.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Hermes added a curved blade of unbreakable metal.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the Gorgons' cave was full of men who came before him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Hundreds of them, frozen mid-scream, turned into *statues*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Perseus walked in *backwards*, eyes on his bronze shield.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In the reflection, three Gorgons slept. Two were immortal.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Only Medusa could die. Her snakes moved even in her sleep.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "One swing of the blade, guided by a mirror.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The head fell into the bag, and Perseus never once looked at it.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "From her neck burst a winged horse, *Pegasus*, and a warrior with a golden sword.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the other two sisters woke up screaming.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "And they could fly. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
